          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakiriko baragenda baganira, haza umukogote w’umuriro ukwegwa n’amafarasi y’umuriro, urabatandukanya, Eliya aduzwa mw’ijuru mu gashururu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa abonye ivyo, arasemerera ati: “Ewe data we, ewe data we! Wewe wabereye Isirayeli nk’imikogote n’abayigenderako!” Elisa ntiyaba akimubona, aca yitaburirako impuzu ayicamwo kubiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
