            "sid": "2KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca atora umutamana wakorotse uva ku bitugu vya Eliya, hanyuma asubira inyuma, ahagarara ku nkengera y’uruzi Yorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afata wa mutamana wakoroka uva kuri Eliya, awukubita amazi y’urwo ruzi. Abaza ati: “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mana ya Eliya, uri hehe?” Akubise urwo ruzi ruca rucikamwo kubiri, amazi amwe ahagarara i buryo, ayandi i bubamfu, hanyuma arajabuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
